,"updated_at":"2026-01-28T21:01:56+08:00","user":{"id":"68a2d887e6740e25e866d1b8","login":"chen-shuai","object_id":"68a2d887e6740e25e866d1b8","name":"chen-shuai","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/chen-shuai"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":161552683,"discussion_id":"b7aaa20b5c0d0540d2d92ddf660b9d9b219ee54b","body":"### CLA Signature Pass  \n chen-shuai, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1: ","created_at":"2026-01-28T21:01:58+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-28T21:01:58+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":161552702,"discussion_id":"f0b7268627351f0434f3f11e37e770b9b26bb2bd","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-01-28T21:02:01+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-28T21:02:01+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":161552752,"discussion_id":"1dd3544ea054fd464d23ba37b2a2c5ec7d33433b","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR主要对量化批矩阵乘法（QuantBatchMatmul）内核代码进行两方面的优化。首先，重构了代码以解决命名空间作用域不明确的问题，通过显式指定枚举常量所属的命名空间，增强了代码的可读性、可维护性，并消除了潜在的命名冲突风险。其次，修复了在特定矩阵转置配置下（`isTransA` 为 `true` 且 `isTransB` 为 `false`）负载均衡逻辑中坐标计算可能错误的问题，确保了计算的准确性。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n修改方案包含两部分核心内容。一是代码规范性重构：将内核函数中多处直接使用的索引枚举常量（如 `IDX_A_OFFSET` 等）统一改为通过其所属的 `QuantBatchMatmul` 命名空间进行限定访问（例如 `QuantBatchMatmul::IDX_A_OFFSET`），并移除了常量 `PER_BLOCK_SIZE` 的类型后缀 `U`。二是算法逻辑修复：优化了 `GetQuantOffset` 函数中的负载均衡条件判断，将原先单一的条件拆分为两个独立的精确条件，分别控制 `mOffset` 和 `nOffset` 的调整，并将 `loadBalanceParam` 参数改为常量引用传递以提升性能。","created_at":"2026-01-28T21:02:36+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-28T21:02:36+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":161552880,"discussion_id":"85c91bf97db29eafe43d51b0e0d13997db90e431","body":"流水线任务触发成功，任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=b582e6c0e2c54a3f8168601c5b292c24&pipelineRunId=ed69494cee3a4b0599d0001e3bceb068&projectName=CANN'>ed69494cee3a4b0599d0001e3bceb068</a></b>]\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse\"><tr><th>任务名称</th><th>状态</th><th>日志</th><th>下载链接</th></tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><strong>codecheck</strong></td>\n                            <td>❌ FAILED</td>\n                            <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/entryCheckDashCode/MR_50e615de11fe46859da03cc79a8c11af/f601b450cbeb6d75500944d59808cdb2?projectId=300033&codeHostingPlatformFlag=gitcode>>>>>></a></td>\n                            <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        </tr> \n                        <tr>\n                            <td><strong>anti_virus</strong></td>\n                            <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                            <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/entryCheckNew/poisoningresult/53452092-15f0-4073-85d8-9aab7671d5b9/CANN/ops-nn?projectName=CANN&codeHostingPlatformFlag=gitcode>>>>>></a></td>\n                            <td><a href=></a></td>\n                        </tr> \n                        <tr>\n                            <td><strong>Check_Pr</strong></td>\n                            <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                            <td><a href=https://www.open